# This file is intentionally empty.
# The MT7927 WiFi driver was merged upstream in kernel 7.2 and the BT driver
# in kernel 7.1.1. For kernels >= 7.2, no out-of-tree MT7927 patches are needed.
# This placeholder has been used to preserve the build script logic in
# .github/workflows/build_kernel.yml, which used to expect a mediatek patch file to exist,
# between the 7.2.4 and 7.2.6 releases from this repo.
